# For Your Eternity

> For Your Eternity is an independent London jeweller making engagement rings, wedding rings, eternity rings, fine jewellery and bespoke commissions. It works with GIA and IGI certified natural and lab-grown diamonds, explains the trade-offs plainly, and makes each piece to order. Founder Edward Marno handles every consultation personally, in person across London or by video.

Key facts:

- Founded in London in 2024. Pieces are hand-finished and hallmarked in a Hatton Garden workshop.
- Natural and lab-grown diamonds, independently certified by GIA or IGI. Natural diamonds are supplied in line with the Kimberley Process; see the ethical sourcing page for what can and cannot be documented.
- Made to order from the collection, or fully bespoke: sketches and renders until the design is right, with a fixed quote before anything is made.
- Free consultation in person across London, by phone or by video.
- Free insured delivery, one free resize within 12 months of delivery, free inspection and cleaning for life, and a lifetime warranty against manufacturing defects.
- Returns: a faulty or incorrect item can be rejected for a full refund within 30 days of delivery, with repair or replacement after that. Made-to-order and personalised pieces cannot be returned for a change of mind.
- A free ring sizer can be ordered online.
- Contact: hello@foryoureternity.com, 0208 178 6687.

